  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Hairline Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "所有內容卡片：18px、1px 髮絲線、內側高光加柔和陰影。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\"><h2 class=\"ds-card-title\">熱門關鍵字</h2><p class=\"ds-card-body\">卡片內容放在 surface 底上，次層用 surface-2。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--hairline,rgba(255,255,255,.06));background:var(--surface,#121b27);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card,0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.04) inset,0 8px 24px rgba(2,6,12,.35));padding:20px;color:var(--ink,#e8eef6);font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",\"PingFang TC\",\"Noto Sans TC\",\"Microsoft JhengHei\",system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-card-title{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2,#a6b5c8)}.ds-card-body{margin:0;font-size:.9375rem;line-height:1.55}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alert Level Badge",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge-alert-high",
      "description": "台股警示等級徽章，讀 --alert-high／--alert-watch，預設琥珀。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-high\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 18v-6a5 5 0 1 1 10 0v6\"/><path d=\"M5 21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2z\"/><path d=\"M21 12h1\"/><path d=\"M18.5 4.5 18 5\"/><path d=\"M2 12h1\"/><path d=\"M12 2v1\"/><path d=\"m4.929 4.929.707.707\"/><path d=\"M12 12v6\"/></svg>高度異常</span> <span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-watch\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4\"/><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"/></svg>留意</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;border-radius:9999px;padding:2px 10px;font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",\"PingFang TC\",system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-badge-high{background:var(--alert-high-soft,rgba(245,158,66,.14));color:var(--alert-high,#f59e42)}.ds-badge-watch{background:var(--alert-watch-soft,rgba(227,194,91,.13));color:var(--alert-watch,#e3c25b)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Caveat Tag",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge-caveat",
      "description": "資料限制提醒：中性底加圖示，不借警示色。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-caveat\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"/></svg>10/8–10/9 未發布，之後尚未收錄</span>",
      "css": ".ds-caveat{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;border-radius:9999px;padding:2px 8px;font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;background:var(--surface-2,#1a2533);color:var(--ink-2,#a6b5c8);word-break:keep-all;font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",\"PingFang TC\",system-ui,sans-serif}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sentiment Pill (US)",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "pill-sentiment-pos",
      "description": "美股情緒標籤：綠正紅負，附圖示與 Mono 信心。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-pos\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"/><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"/></svg>正面 <span class=\"ds-num\">92%</span></span> <span class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-neg\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"22 17 13.5 8.5 8.5 13.5 2 7\"/><polyline points=\"16 17 22 17 22 11\"/></svg>負面 <span class=\"ds-num\">99%</span></span>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;border-radius:9999px;padding:2px 8px;font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-pill-pos{background:var(--pos-soft,rgba(63,207,142,.14));color:var(--pos,#3fcf8e)}.ds-pill-neg{background:var(--neg-soft,rgba(244,98,104,.14));color:var(--neg,#f46268)}.ds-num{font-family:\"IBM Plex Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Segmented Control",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "segmented",
      "description": "膠囊形分段控制；選中底在選項間滑動。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"列出哪些股票\"><button class=\"ds-seg-opt\" aria-pressed=\"true\">需要查證 2 檔</button><button class=\"ds-seg-opt\" aria-pressed=\"false\">全部 49 檔</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg{display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4px;padding:4px;border-radius:9999px;border:1px solid var(--hairline,rgba(255,255,255,.06));background:var(--surface,#121b27);min-width:320px}.ds-seg-opt{min-height:40px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink-3,#7a8ca3);font:400 .9375rem/1.55 \"IBM Plex Sans\",\"PingFang TC\",system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s,background .25s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}.ds-seg-opt:hover{color:var(--ink-2,#a6b5c8)}.ds-seg-opt[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--surface-3,#223042);color:var(--ink,#e8eef6);font-weight:600}.ds-seg-opt:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--brand,#5aa9e6);outline-offset:2px}.ds-seg-opt:active{transform:scale(.97)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Choice Chip",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "chip-choice-active",
      "description": "參數選擇膠囊（門檻模擬）：選中用鋼藍實底。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">10 日</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\">20 日</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">40 日</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:4px}.ds-chip{min-height:36px;padding:0 12px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--surface-2,#1a2533);color:var(--ink-2,#a6b5c8);font:400 .75rem/1.4 \"IBM Plex Sans\",\"PingFang TC\",system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s}.ds-chip:hover{color:var(--ink,#e8eef6)}.ds-chip[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--brand,#5aa9e6);color:var(--brand-fg,#06101a);font-weight:600}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--brand,#5aa9e6);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Keyword Tag",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "美股新聞標題下方的關鍵字標籤：其他追蹤標的用鋼藍淡底與 Mono 代號，主題用 surface-2 底與 ink-2 字；不可點。主題來自固定英文詞表（lib/topics.ts），只比對標題文字。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tags\"><span class=\"ds-tag ds-tag-ticker\">NVDA</span><span class=\"ds-tag\">股價異動</span><span class=\"ds-tag\">AI</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.4; } .ds-tag { border-radius: 9999px; padding: 2px 8px; background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--ink-2); } .ds-tag-ticker { background: var(--brand-soft); color: var(--brand); font-family: var(--font-mono); }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Keyword Filter Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "新聞分頁情緒篩選下方的關鍵字篩選膠囊：36px 高、髮絲線框、附 Mono 則數；選中改為鋼藍框與鋼藍淡底。可複選，列出符合任一個的新聞。",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-kw\" aria-pressed=\"true\">大盤 <span class=\"ds-kw-n\">7</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-kw { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; min-height: 36px; padding: 0 12px; border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 9999px; background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink-2); font: inherit; font-size: 0.75rem; cursor: pointer; } .ds-kw[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { border-color: var(--brand); background: var(--brand-soft); color: var(--brand); font-weight: 600; } .ds-kw-n { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ink-3); }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Icon Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "icon-button",
      "description": "44px 圓形圖示按鈕，hover 換次層底。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-icon-btn\" aria-label=\"重新整理\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8\"/><path d=\"M21 3v5h-5\"/><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16\"/><path d=\"M8 16H3v5\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-icon-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink-2,#a6b5c8);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,color .15s}.ds-icon-btn:hover{background:var(--surface-2,#1a2533);color:var(--ink,#e8eef6)}.ds-icon-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--brand,#5aa9e6);outline-offset:2px}.ds-icon-btn:active{transform:scale(.97)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mobile Tab Bar",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-tab-active",
      "description": "手機底部 6 分頁列，毛玻璃，選中項是鋼藍淡底膠囊。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tabbar\" aria-label=\"主選單\"><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\">總覽</a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\">新聞</a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\">追蹤</a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\">警示</a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\">產業</a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\">設定</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tabbar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);height:64px;padding:0 4px;border-top:1px solid var(--hairline,rgba(255,255,255,.06));background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--background,#0b121c) 75%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(24px) saturate(1.5)}.ds-tab{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding-top:22px;color:var(--ink-3,#7a8ca3);font:400 .75rem/1.4 \"IBM Plex Sans\",\"PingFang TC\",system-ui,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;transition:color .15s}.ds-tab::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:6px;width:56px;height:32px;border-radius:9999px}.ds-tab:hover{color:var(--ink-2,#a6b5c8)}.ds-tab[aria-current=page]{color:var(--brand,#5aa9e6);font-weight:600}.ds-tab[aria-current=page]::before{background:var(--brand-soft,rgba(90,169,230,.14))}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--brand,#5aa9e6);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Strip",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "status-strip",
      "description": "頂列下方固定高度的狀態列；有問題的項目轉鋼藍加圖示並排到最前。",
      "html": "<dl class=\"ds-strip\" aria-label=\"資料狀態\"><div class=\"ds-strip-item\"><dt>資料更新</dt><dd class=\"ds-strip-warn\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4\"/><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"/></svg>10/8 14:02，可能已過期</dd></div><div class=\"ds-strip-item\"><dt>台股警示</dt><dd>10/12，2 檔需要查證</dd></div><div class=\"ds-strip-item\"><dt>台股評分</dt><dd>正常</dd></div></dl>",
      "css": ".ds-strip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0 16px;height:32px;margin:0;padding:0 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--hairline,rgba(255,255,255,.06));font:400 .75rem/1.4 \"IBM Plex Sans\",\"PingFang TC\",system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap;overflow-x:auto}.ds-strip-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}.ds-strip dt{color:var(--ink-3,#7a8ca3)}.ds-strip dd{margin:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink,#e8eef6)}.ds-strip dd.ds-strip-warn{color:var(--brand,#5aa9e6)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sector Heatmap Cells",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "div-pos",
      "description": "產業熱度圖格子：藍正、琥珀（或紅）負、灰中性，空格只畫髮絲線，警示日加圓點。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-heat\"><button class=\"ds-cell\" style=\"background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--div-neg,#d9822b) 100%,var(--div-mid,#383835))\" aria-label=\"很強負面\"></button><button class=\"ds-cell\" style=\"background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--div-neg,#d9822b) 50%,var(--div-mid,#383835))\" aria-label=\"中等負面，有警示\"><span class=\"ds-dot\"></span></button><button class=\"ds-cell\" style=\"background:var(--div-mid,#383835)\" aria-label=\"中性\"></button><button class=\"ds-cell ds-cell-empty\" aria-label=\"沒有新聞\"></button><button class=\"ds-cell\" style=\"background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--div-pos,#3987e5) 50%,var(--div-mid,#383835))\" aria-label=\"中等正面\"></button><button class=\"ds-cell\" style=\"background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--div-pos,#3987e5) 100%,var(--div-mid,#383835))\" aria-label=\"很強正面\"></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-heat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,28px);gap:2px}.ds-cell{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:20px;border:0;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer;padding:0}.ds-cell-empty{background:transparent;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--hairline,rgba(255,255,255,.06))}.ds-cell:hover{filter:brightness(1.15)}.ds-cell:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--brand,#5aa9e6);outline-offset:1px}.ds-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--ink,#e8eef6)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "行情板",
    "overview": "這是一張夜盤時段的行情板：預設深色，夜盤藍底（`night-ground`）上浮著一層層髮絲線卡片，鋼藍是唯一的品牌色，數字一律用 IBM Plex Mono 等寬對齊。介面密度偏高但不擁擠，研究員在開盤前幾分鐘掃過去，就要知道哪幾檔需要查證、公司有沒有說明。淺色主題是同一張行情板換成白天的紙面：結構、角色與規則不變，只換色值。\n\n顏色帶語意，而且語意因市場而異。美股頁沿用美股慣例：綠色正面、紅色負面。台股頁避開綠色（免得和「跌」混淆），警示等級預設用琥珀（台灣讀者看到紅色會讀成「漲」），設定頁可改成紅色，選擇存在使用者的裝置。資料限制與系統提醒（還沒開盤、資料過期、公告漏收、評分額度用盡）一律用中性灰或鋼藍加圖示，不借用警示色。每處顏色都搭配文字或圖示，顏色不單獨承載語意。\n\n動態節制而一致：大量元素用 CSS keyframes 淡入上移，指示器膠囊用彈簧在選項間滑動，全部尊重「減少動態」設定。載入中的骨架與真實內容同高，資料到了版面不跳。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "預設深色，夜盤藍底，頂部一抹鋼藍光暈給景深",
      "髮絲線邊框＋內側高光＋柔和陰影的卡片，大圓角（18px）",
      "單一品牌色鋼藍；語意色依市場切換慣例",
      "數字一律等寬、表格數字（tabular-nums），文字用 Plex Sans，中文走系統字",
      "手機底部 6 分頁列，桌機左側欄；每一頁頂列下方都有固定高度的狀態列",
      "膠囊形分段控制，選中的底色用彈簧滑動"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Amber-Is-Alert Rule",
        "body": "琥珀在台股頁只代表警示等級（高度異常、留意）與熱度圖的負值，不代表漲跌，也不拿來當提醒色。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Caveat-Is-Not-Alert Rule",
        "body": "資料限制與系統提醒用中性灰（`surface-2` 底、`ink-2` 字）或鋼藍，並一定附圖示（CircleAlert、Clock、Info、TriangleAlert）；不用琥珀或紅色。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two-Markets Rule",
        "body": "美股頁綠正紅負；台股頁不出現綠色，正面在熱度圖用藍色。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Never-Color-Alone Rule",
        "body": "每個語意色都有文字（「高度異常」「負面」）或圖示同行，色盲與灰階下也讀得懂。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Mono-Numbers Rule",
        "body": "會被比較的數字（分數、z 值、則數、日期、代號）一律 Plex Mono 加 tabular-nums；中文說明不用等寬。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two-Weights Rule",
        "body": "只有 400 與 600 兩個字重；層級靠字級與墨色深淺，不靠更多字重。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The No-Jump Rule",
        "body": "每個會非同步載入的區塊，骨架高度貼近真實內容；資料到了不把下方內容往下推。",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Hairline-Card Rule",
        "body": "卡片 = 18px 圓角 + 1px 髮絲線 + Card 陰影 + `surface` 底，集中在一個 `card` utility；不另外發明卡片樣式。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 讓台股警示等級只讀 `--alert-high`／`--alert-watch`，配色切換由 `data-alert-palette` 決定。",
      "Do 用中性灰或鋼藍加圖示表達資料限制與系統提醒。",
      "Do 美股頁用 `pos` 綠正面、`neg` 紅負面；台股頁的正面用 `div-pos` 藍。",
      "Do 所有比較用數字用 Plex Mono 加 tabular-nums。",
      "Do 卡片一律走 `card` utility（18px、髮絲線、Card 陰影）。",
